<SPT><TTL>SYNTHETIC OR MANUFACTURED ADDITIVES</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Commercial fertilizers are an example of a synthetic or manufactured additive.  A <SUB>Certificate of Analysis for 
Synthetic or Manufactured Additives</SUB> must accompany each shipping unit of synthetic or manufactured additive supplied 
by the vendor.</TXT><BRK/>
